## The Situation
This is everything the author knows, and all of it is true:
{{ situation }}

{% set sig = default(signature, "") %}
## Rules
- Write in the first person, from the author to {{ recipientName }} ("you"): roughly 2-5 sentences, a note someone paid ink and a courier for, not an essay.
- The letter must accomplish this: {{ goal }}
- Tone: {{ tone }}
- Ground every claim in the situation above. Invent no names, places, gold amounts or events it does not give, except a detail the goal asks you to supply. If the situation names an amount, use it exactly.
{% if sig != "" %}- End with exactly this signature line, alone on its own line after the body: {{ sig }}
{% endif %}- In-world Tamriel voice only: no modern idioms, no meta, no game terms.{% if sig == "" %} Add a closing or signature only if it comes naturally to the author.{% endif %}
- "subject" is the short title written on the folded note: 2-6 in-world words naming the matter, in the author's own manner.
[ end system ]

[ user ]
